<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png">
  <title>Pricing — Maal</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Free, Pro $20/mo, and Max $200/mo. Simple subscription pricing for a financial wellbeing score and plain-English action plan, built for Australians.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,400..800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/retro-theme.css">
  <style>
    body { background: var(--bg); min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    main { flex: 1; }
    .pr-section { padding: 5rem 1.5rem 3rem; text-align: center; }
    .pr-kicker { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .18em; color: var(--fg-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .pr-h1 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem,6vw,3.5rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.03em; line-height: 1.05; }
    .pr-sub { margin: 1.25rem auto 0; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--fg-muted); max-width: 480px; line-height: 1.65; }
    .billing-toggle { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: .25rem; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem; padding: .25rem; width: fit-content; background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 9999px; }
    .bt-opt { border: none; background: none; padding: .5rem 1rem; border-radius: 9999px; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--fg-muted); cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--font-body); transition: all .15s; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; }
    .bt-opt.active { background: var(--surface); color: var(--fg); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .bt-save { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; color: var(--accent); }
    .tiers { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem 4rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 1rem; }
    @media (max-width: 800px) { .tiers { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .tier { padding: 2rem; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .tier.featured { border-color: var(--fg); }
    .tier-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .tier-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .14em; color: var(--fg-muted); }
    .tier-badge { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .16em; color: var(--mint); }
    .tier-price { margin-top: 1rem; display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: .5rem; }
    .tier-price-num { font-size: 2.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.03em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .tier-price-per { font-size: 12px; color: var(--fg-muted); }
    .tier-desc { margin-top: .75rem; font-size: 13px; color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.6; }
    .tier-list { margin-top: 1.5rem; list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .625rem; flex: 1; }
    .tier-list li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: .5rem; font-size: 13px; }
    .tier-check { color: var(--mint); font-size: 14px; margin-top: .1rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .tier-cta { margin-top: 1.75rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: .625rem 1rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; transition: all .15s; }
    .tier-cta.solid { background: var(--fg); color: #fff; }
    .tier-cta.solid:hover { opacity: .88; }
    .tier-cta.outline { border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--fg); }
    .tier-cta.outline:hover { background: var(--surface-2); }
    .compare { padding: 5rem 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); background: rgba(0,0,0,.02); }
    html[data-theme="dark"] .compare { background: rgba(255,255,255,.015); }
    .compare-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .compare h2 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem,3vw,1.75rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.03em; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
    .compare-table { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    .compare-table thead tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .compare-table th { padding: 1rem 1.25rem; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .14em; color: var(--fg-muted); text-align: center; }
    .compare-table th:first-child { text-align: left; }
    .compare-table td { padding: .875rem 1.25rem; font-size: 13px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .compare-table td:first-child { text-align: left; }
    .compare-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    .c-check { color: var(--mint); }
    .c-dash { color: var(--fg-muted); opacity: .35; }
    .disclaimer-block { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem 4rem; font-size: 11px; color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.8; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <main>
    <section class="pr-section">
      <p class="pr-kicker">Pricing</p>
      <h1 class="pr-h1">Simple pricing.<br>No hidden agenda.</h1>
      <p class="pr-sub">We make money from your subscription — nothing else. Maal replaces the spreadsheet and the awkward annual review. Cancel anytime. All amounts in AUD.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="billing-toggle">
      <button type="button" class="bt-opt active" data-period="monthly" onclick="setPeriod('monthly')">Monthly</button>
      <button type="button" class="bt-opt" data-period="annual" onclick="setPeriod('annual')">Annual <span class="bt-save">2 months free</span></button>
    </div>

    <div class="tiers">
      <div class="tier">
        <div class="tier-top"><span class="tier-name">Free</span></div>
        <div class="tier-price">
          <span class="tier-price-num">$0</span>
          <span class="tier-price-per">forever, no card required</span>
        </div>
        <p class="tier-desc">Start building your full financial picture with Maal.</p>
        <ul class="tier-list">
          <li><span class="tier-check">&#10003;</span> Limited Ask Maal chat, research and radar usage each month</li>
          <li><span class="tier-check">&#10003;</span> Track accounts, real estate, crypto, vehicles, debt and more</li>
          <li><span class="tier-check">&#10003;</span> Net worth, transactions, allocations and performance</li>
          <li><span class="tier-check">&#10003;</span> Bank connections pause after 30 days of inactivity — reconnect any time</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/signup" class="tier-cta outline">Start free</a>
      </div>

      <div class="tier featured">
        <div class="tier-top">
          <span class="tier-name">Pro</span>
          <span class="tier-badge">Recommended</span>
        </div>
        <div class="tier-price">
          <span class="tier-price-num price-monthly">$20</span>
          <span class="tier-price-num price-annual" style="display:none">$200</span>
          <span class="tier-price-per price-monthly">AUD / month</span>
          <span class="tier-price-per price-annual" style="display:none">AUD / year</span>
        </div>
        <p class="tier-desc">For active users who use Maal regularly.</p>
        <ul class="tier-list">
          <li><span class="tier-check">&#10003;</span> Everything in Free</li>
          <li><span class="tier-check">&#10003;</span> 10x the monthly usage across chat, research and radars</li>
          <li><span class="tier-check">&#10003;</span> The latest frontier AI models</li>
          <li><span class="tier-check">&#10003;</span> The most robust, accurate financial data</li>
          <li><span class="tier-check">&#10003;</span> Ask for any report — an EOFY super summary, a net worth snapshot — and Maal emails it to you</li>
          <li><span class="tier-check">&#10003;</span> Priority support</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/signup" class="tier-cta solid">Get Pro</a>
      </div>

      <div class="tier">
        <div class="tier-top"><span class="tier-name">Max</span></div>
        <div class="tier-price">
          <span class="tier-price-num">$200</span>
          <span class="tier-price-per">AUD / month</span>
        </div>
        <p class="tier-desc">For people who want a second set of eyes on serious money — with Mahmoud, personally.</p>
        <ul class="tier-list">
          <li><span class="tier-check">&#10003;</span> Everything in Pro</li>
          <li><span class="tier-check">&#10003;</span> 10x Pro's usage across chat, research and radars</li>
          <li><span class="tier-check">&#10003;</span> Personal setup with founder Mahmoud</li>
          <li><span class="tier-check">&#10003;</span> Early access to new features</li>
          <li><span class="tier-check">&#10003;</span> Top-level priority support</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact" class="tier-cta outline">Talk to us</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="compare">
      <div class="compare-inner">
        <h2>Feature comparison</h2>
        <table class="compare-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Feature</th>
              <th>Free</th>
              <th>Pro</th>
              <th>Max</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Maal Score (0–100)</td><td><span class="c-check">&#10003;</span></td><td><span class="c-check">&#10003;</span></td><td><span class="c-check">&#10003;</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td>Connect accounts, real estate, crypto, vehicles &amp; debt</td><td><span class="c-check">&#10003;</span></td><td><span class="c-check">&#10003;</span></td><td><span class="c-check">&#10003;</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td>Net worth, transactions, allocations &amp; performance</td><td><span class="c-check">&#10003;</span></td><td><span class="c-check">&#10003;</span></td><td><span class="c-check">&#10003;</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td>Ask Maal chat, research &amp; radars</td><td>Limited</td><td>10x Free</td><td>10x Pro</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Frontier AI models &amp; most accurate financial data</td><td><span class="c-dash">—</span></td><td><span class="c-check">&#10003;</span></td><td><span class="c-check">&#10003;</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td>Any report — EOFY super summary, net worth snapshot — emailed on request</td><td><span class="c-dash">—</span></td><td><span class="c-check">&#10003;</span></td><td><span class="c-check">&#10003;</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td>Priority support</td><td><span class="c-dash">—</span></td><td><span class="c-check">&#10003;</span></td><td>Top-level</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Personal setup with founder Mahmoud</td><td><span class="c-dash">—</span></td><td><span class="c-dash">—</span></td><td><span class="c-check">&#10003;</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td>Early access to new features</td><td><span class="c-dash">—</span></td><td><span class="c-dash">—</span></td><td><span class="c-check">&#10003;</span></td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="disclaimer-block">
      DISCLAIMER: Maal does not provide financial advice. Any information provided by Maal is for educational purposes only. You should do your own research. Investing is risky and you can lose all of your money.
    </div>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <%- analyticsSnippet %>
  <script>
    function setPeriod(period) {
      document.querySelectorAll('.bt-opt').forEach(function(b) { b.classList.toggle('active', b.dataset.period === period); });
      document.querySelectorAll('.price-monthly').forEach(function(el) { el.style.display = period === 'monthly' ? '' : 'none'; });
      document.querySelectorAll('.price-annual').forEach(function(el) { el.style.display = period === 'annual' ? '' : 'none'; });
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>